  "text": "This series argues modeling decisions, and the ways they fail. Code comes on screen only as evidence. After this one, nine videos answer the track's other hundred and forty-five questions, each once: facts and grain, dimensions that change, how dbt builds a project, incremental models, advanced sequel, warehouses and what they cost, testing, metrics, and the assistants that read them. Every topic page has concept checks, three of them add challenges that run in the browser, and a bank of a hundred and ten multiple-choice questions covers the whole track. Every round starts from a model, and every model from its grain. Next: facts, dimensions and grain.",
